--- A. the override list as seeded
 venue_id |  venue_name   | forced_type |  set_by  
----------+---------------+-------------+----------
   101329 | Toyota Center | axs_primary | operator

--- B. an insert carrying another brand is relabelled when AXS sells it, and left alone when it does not
 axs_event_id |    venue_name    |   ticketer   | axs_ticketed |      type      
--------------+------------------+--------------+--------------+----------------
          701 | Toyota Center    | nba          | t            | axs_primary
          702 | Toyota Center    | toyotacenter | t            | axs_primary
          703 | Toyota Center    | ticketmaster | f            | other_ticketer
          704 | Crypto.com Arena | nba          | t            | other_ticketer

--- C. an export pass that re-sends the original type does not undo it (the UPDATE path)
 axs_event_id |   ticketer   | axs_ticketed |      type      
--------------+--------------+--------------+----------------
          701 | nba          | t            | axs_primary
          702 | toyotacenter | t            | axs_primary
          703 | ticketmaster | f            | other_ticketer

--- D. an event that stops being AXS-sold keeps the type the feed gives it
 axs_event_id | axs_ticketed |      type      
--------------+--------------+----------------
          701 | f            | other_ticketer

--- E. a venue not on the override list is never touched
 axs_event_id |    venue_name    |      type      
--------------+------------------+----------------
          704 | Crypto.com Arena | other_ticketer
